    "It holds %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hij bevat %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It holds %@. They are lost, and so is the branch. Files git ignores in it, such as .env or a local database, go too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hij bevat %@. Die gaan verloren, en de branch ook. Bestanden die git erin negeert, zoals .env of een lokale database, verdwijnen ook."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is locked with git worktree lock." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hij is vergrendeld met git worktree lock."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is merged in the checkout that has %@ out. Nothing is stashed and no branch is moved behind a working tree." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hij wordt gemerged in de checkout waarin %@ is uitgecheckt. Er wordt niets gestasht en geen branch verschoven achter een working tree."
          }
        }
      }
    },
