            "value" : "De tekening ontbreekt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file changed on the machine and was read again. Answers that still fit were kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het bestand is op de machine gewijzigd en opnieuw gelezen. Antwoorden die nog passen, zijn bewaard."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file goes back to what it was, and git keeps a stash to undo it with." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het bestand gaat terug naar hoe het was, en git bewaart een stash om dat ongedaan te maken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is taken out of the checkout on both sides of the %@." : {
      "comment" : "%@ is a git operation: merge, rebase, cherry-pick or revert",
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het bestand wordt aan beide kanten van de %@ uit de checkout gehaald."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The files of this turn are no longer in the repository, so the worktree starts from HEAD." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De bestanden van deze turn zitten niet meer in de repository, dus de worktree begint bij HEAD."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The files stay as they are now; the agent is told the folder is newer than this turn." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De bestanden blijven zoals ze nu zijn; de agent krijgt te horen dat de map nieuwer is dan deze turn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first %lld matches in %lld files. Narrow the search for the rest." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
